      "premiereBadge": null,
      "poster": "/assets/posters/firebird.webp",
      "posterAlt": "The Firebird — official poster",
      "blurb": "Stravinsky reimagined — a village closed to new ideas, transformed by one free spirit.",
      "description": [
        "A modern reinterpretation of Stravinsky's fairytale about a prince entering an enchanted land. In Ján Ďurovčík's powerful vision, a fearful village closed to new ideas is transformed by the arrival of a free-spirited young man whose love inspires both villagers and audience to think, dream and act freely.",
        "Blending Slavic influences into a unified artistic language, Ďurovčík creates a work of total theatre. A striking symbol of constraint — dancers performing in rubber boots — becomes both a metaphor for limited thought and a demanding technical challenge for the company's finest interpreters."
      ],
      "credits": {
        "Choreography and Direction": "Ján Ďurovčík",
        "Music": "Igor Stravinsky",
        "Costumes": "Alexandra Grusková"
      },
